{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_60_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_60","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_60_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_60","textTraditional":"三十有一年春，築臺于郎。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_60_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_60","textTraditional":"夏四月，薛伯卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_60_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_60","textTraditional":"築臺于薛。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_60_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_60","textTraditional":"六月，齊侯來獻戎捷。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_60_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_60","textTraditional":"秋，築臺于秦。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_60_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_60","textTraditional":"冬，不雨。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_60_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_60","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_60_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_60","textTraditional":"三十一年夏六月，齊侯來獻戎捷，非禮也。凡諸侯有四夷之功，則獻于王，王以警于夷。中國則否。諸侯不相遺俘。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}